<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University. ASU is unique because we are one university in many places. We have four distinct locations in the Phoenix metropolitan area offering undergraduate programs. Freshmen are expected to live on the campus of their major, but students have access to courses, activities and opportunities at all of our locations. A free intercampus shuttle helps students get between locations.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">ASU's online tours introduce you to the beauty and identity of each campus.</font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/tour/downtown/index.html">Downtown Phoenix campus</a></span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/tour/polytechnic/index.html">Polytechnic campus</a></span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/tour/tempe/index.html">Tempe campus</a></span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/tour/west/index.html">West campus</a></span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">See what <a href="http://asu.edu/myfuture/study.html">your future</a> could look like at ASU.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font><br></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
